  "description": "Erection of a two storey side extension, part single storey side/rear extension, erection of a rear/side roof extension, conversion of the garage into a habitable room and conversion of to form four self-contained flats (2 x 2 bed, 1 x 1 bed and 1 x studio) with associated parking and amenities",
